a,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;&quot;&gt;The approver has decided on application {!$Record.Application.Name} from {!$Record.Application.Organization_Name__c}. You evaluated this application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 15px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;&quot;&gt;The decision:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table role=&quot;presentation&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background:#F7F2F2;border-left:3px solid #F2672A;border-radius:3px;margin:4px 0 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:16px 20px;font-family:&apos;Open Sans&apos;,&apos;Segoe UI&apos;,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#414042;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The decision:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outcome:&lt;/strong&gt; {!$Record.Proposal_Review__r.Recommend_for_CEO_review__c}&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recorded:&lt;/strong&gt; {!$Record.Proposal_Review__r.Evaluation_Completed__c}&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application:&lt;/strong&gt; {!$Record.Application.Name}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 15px;font-family:&apos;Open Sans&apos;,&apos;Segoe UI&apos;,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;&quot;&gt;No action is needed from you on this application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 15px;font-family:&apos;Open Sans&apos;,&apos;Segoe UI&apos;,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;&quot;&gt;The applicant is told separately, once the 7 day window that follows a recorded decision closes. Do not contact them in the meantime.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 15px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;&quot;&gt;Kind regards,&lt;br&gt;Wadhwani Grants Platform&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot; class=&quot;pad&quot; style=&quot;padding:0 32px;&quot;&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #E6E6E6;margin:6px 0 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot; class=&quot;pad&quot; style=&quot;padding:22px 32px 26px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://wadhwanifoundation--wfdev.sandbox.my.salesforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015e10000020VVh&amp;oid=00DF6000000APXN&amp;lastMod=1782560396000&quot; width=&quot;132&quot; alt=&quot;Wadhwani Grants&quot; class=&quot;logo-ftr&quot; style=&quot;display:block;width:132px;height:auto;margin:0 0 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 4px;font-family:&apos;Open Sans&apos;,&apos;Segoe UI&apos;,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6D6E71;&quot;&gt;Wadhwani Grants, the grant-making arm of the Wadhwani Foundation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 4px;font-family:&apos;Open Sans&apos;,&apos;Segoe UI&apos;,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6D6E71;&quot;&gt;You are receiving this because you evaluated application {{application_number}}.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 4px;font-family:&apos;Open Sans&apos;,&apos;Segoe UI&apos;,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6D6E71;&quot;&gt;An automated notice from the Wadhwani Grants Platform. The applicant is not copied on this email.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 4px;font-family:&apos;Open Sans&apos;,&apos;Segoe UI&apos;,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6D6E71;&quot;&gt;&amp;copy; {!CurrentYear} Wadhwani Charitable Foundation. All rights reserved.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
</Flow>
